        "title": "Extract fastRewrite to backend/src/fast-rewrite.ts",
        "summary": "Moves `fastRewrite` and `shouldAddFilePlaceholders` from `backend/src/process-file-block.ts` into new `backend/src/fast-rewrite.ts`. Removes `[UPDATED_BY_ANOTHER_ASSISTANT]` early return from `processFileBlock`. Updates `processFileBlock` to import `fastRewrite` and `shouldAddFilePlaceholders` from the new module. Deletes dead code from `process-file-block.ts`.",
