        "title": "Update preserveCommentsInEditSnippet prompt and agent instructions",
        "summary": "Refined the `preserveCommentsInEditSnippet` prompt in `backend/src/fast-rewrite.ts` to prioritize preserving the edit snippet structure while adding back original comments and removing meta-comments. Added a rule to `backend/src/system-prompt/agent-instructions.md` requiring agents to run newly created unit tests. Includes updated tests in `backend/src/__tests__/fast-rewrite.test.ts`.",
