        "text": "The system that writes code edits now has clearer instructions for keeping the right comments and dropping the unnecessary ones, so edits keep helpful notes from the original file without clutter. The automated helper is also told it must run any new practice checks it writes and make sure they pass before finishing. These are behind-the-scenes tuning steps; regular visitors to the app won't see any changes yet.",
